From f216cb0170ed8b997ee10497b77ea3acc06ec714 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: schoeremy <jeremyfroeb2007@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 05:36:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 17/44] nxhost nvn: support the Splatoon 3 NVN driver

The Splatoon 3 11.3.0 sdk (574284b4) ships a newer NVN driver than MK8DX:

- nvnDeviceGetInteger API_MAJOR/MINOR_VERSION: the driver reports 55/15
  (0x4c7400, switch table 0x99ba3a). The game requires major == 55 and
  minor >= 15 before it creates its graphics system; with MK8's 53/105 it
  skipped that and later dereferenced a null global. Now per driver table.
- Builders and texture views have a different layout (texture builder
  format at 0x38 instead of 0x30, sampler filters/wrap/compare packed into
  0x2c..0x2f, views as a flag word). New abi.rs reads such a driver's
  structs through its own leaf getter procs (each checked to be a
  self-contained leaf by a control-flow walk before being called from the
  host) and converts them to the MK8DX layout the rest of nxhost uses.
  MK8DX keeps the raw reads (StructAbi::Native).
- The driver's MemoryPool object differs (cpu 0x30, gpu 0x18, size 0x38),
  so for getter drivers Map/GetBufferAddress/GetFlags/GetSize are answered
  from the host pool table instead of passed through.
- nvnProgramSetShadersExt: 0x18-byte entries whose first 16 bytes are the
  NVNshaderData SetShaders takes (driver 0x4cbd60 splits them the same way).
- nvnTexture{GetFlags,GetSamples,GetStride,GetDepthStencilMode,
  GetMemoryPool,GetMemoryOffset,GetSwizzle} and nvnSamplerGet* were stubs
  returning 0; they now answer from the stored canonical builder.
- Host stubs also return their value in d0 (caller-saved), so float
  getters (LodBias, MaxAnisotropy) work.
